ing zone design</h3>\n          <p>Build a landing zone that includes identity onboarding, resource hierarchy, network design, and security controls.</p>\n        </article>\n        <article class=\"foundation-card\">\n          <h3>Enterprise foundations blueprint</h3>\n          <p>Build a foundation for governance, security scale, visibility, and access.</p>\n        </article>\n        <article class=\"foundation-card\">\n          <h3>Delivery Navigator ↗</h3>\n          <p>Accelerate cloud solution deployments with implementation plans and technical guides from Google Cloud Consulting.</p>\n        </article>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"guidance\">\n      <h2>Discover domain-specific architecture guidance</h2>\n      <div class=\"guidance-layout\">\n        <aside class=\"filter\">\n          <div class=\"filter-title\"><span class=\"filter-icon\">☰</span> FILTER BY</div>\n          <ul>\n            <li>AI and ML</li>\n            <li>Application development</li>\n            <li>Big data and analytics</li>\n            <li>Databases</li>\n            <li>Hybrid and multicloud</li>\n            <li>Migration</li>\n            <li>Monitoring and Logging</li>\n            <li>Networking</li>\n            <li>Reliability and DR</li>\n            <li>Security and compliance</li>\n            <li>Storage</li>\n          </ul>\n        </aside>\n\n        <section class=\"results\">\n          <input class=\"results-input\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"Filter results\" aria-label=\"Filter results\">\n          <div class=\"results-grid\">\n            <article class=\"guide-card\">\n              <h3>DevOps capabilities</h3>\n              <div class=\"date\">Updated May 21, 2026</div>\n              <p>A set of capabilities that drive higher software delivery and organizational performance, as identified and validated by the DevOps Research and Assessment (DORA) team.</p>\n            </article>\n            <article class=\"guide-card\">